SUMMARY:Treasure Sale: Donation Drop-Off
DESCRIPTION:Treasure Sale Donation drop-off dates: June 13-17\, 11:30 AM – 4:30 PM \nThe Pence Gallery’s Treasure Sale is set for June 19-22! If you would like to donate jewelry\, vintage or retro-inspired clothing\, fine art\, small furniture\, rugs\, collectibles\, and more\, we encourage you to bring them by between June 13-17. No need to call before drop-off during these dates\, and all donations will receive a tax donation form. \nPlease note that we are NOT accepting: glassware\, worn out clothing\, large frames and furniture\, books\, kitchen gadgets\, exercise equipment\, electronics\, or broken items. Thank you! \nLearn more at https://pencegallery.org/events/treasure-sale/.
