SUMMARY:Elite Performance: Holistic Care for Athletes from Campus to the National Stage
DESCRIPTION:Participate in the upcoming Women & Philanthropy Speaker Series virtual event\, Elite Performance: Holistic Care for Athletes from Campus to the National Stage. \nJoin LeShelle May as she welcomes Dr. Marcia Faustin to the Women & Philanthropy virtual stage for an inspiring and fascinating conversation. Drawing from her work in family and sports medicine\, Dr. Faustin has cared for athletes at every level\, including her role with the USA Women’s Gymnastics National Team during the 2020 and 2024 Olympic Games. Her journey as both a physician and a leader in Division I athletics has shaped her deep commitment to supporting the holistic health and well-being of student-athletes. We will explore Dr. Faustin’s advocacy for women in sports medicine and her approach to guiding athletes from campus to the national stage. You won’t want to miss this engaging discussion. \nEvent Details:\nRegister in advance via provided link\nTuesday\, June 16\n12:00 p.m. Pacific
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/elite-performance-holistic-care-for-athletes-from-campus-to-the-national-stage/
CATEGORIES:Athletics,Sports
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://thedirt.online/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Untitled-design-4.jpg
END:VEVENT
